    "faq_uae": {
      "type": "faq-hub",
      "blocks": {
        "u1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category": "UAE-wide Delivery",
            "tags": "uae,next day,coverage,10pm",
            "question": "Do you cover the whole UAE?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Next-day coverage across all seven emirates. Most of our deliveries go to <strong>Abu Dhabi, Sharjah, Ajman and Ras Al Khaimah</strong>, so next-day outside Dubai is routine, not the exception. Order before the cut-off to receive by evening.</p>",
            "sources": ""
          }
        },
        "u2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category": "UAE-wide Delivery",
            "tags": "plan,expectations",
            "question": "When should I expect my UAE order?",
            "answer": "<p>Order by 6 PM for next-day UAE delivery. Orders placed after 6 PM are processed the following day. Delivery dates are estimates, not guarantees; checkout and tracking show the current status.</p>",
            "sources": ""
          }
        },
        "u3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category": "UAE-wide Delivery",
            "tags": "address format,phone,notes",
            "question": "Best way to write my address & phone",
            "answer": "<p><strong>Building/Community → Street → Area → Emirate</strong> + phone with country code. Add entrance/reception details to help the driver reach you on the first attempt.</p>",
            "sources": ""
          }
        },
        "u4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category": "UAE-wide Delivery",
            "tags": "missed,reattempt,reschedule",
            "question": "Missed delivery in another emirate?",
            "answer": "<p>Reply to your tracking SMS/email with your preferred time. We’ll arrange a re-attempt quickly.</p>",
            "sources": ""
          }
        },
        "u5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category": "UAE-wide Delivery",
            "tags": "freezone,free zone,restricted,gated,undeliverable,jafza,difc,kizad",
            "question": "My address is in a freezone or gated area. Can you deliver?",
            "answer": "<p>Some freezones and gated compounds restrict courier access, which can put your order on hold as <strong>undeliverable</strong>. The fix is easy: give us a reachable hand-off point (your building reception, a security gate, or a nearby home/office address) and add any access notes at checkout. Already ordered? Message us your order number and an alternative drop-off and we’ll re-book right away.</p>",
            "sources": ""
          }
        },
        "u6": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category": "UAE-wide Delivery",
            "tags": "unreachable,no answer,rto,return to origin,failed delivery,attempts",
            "question": "What happens if the driver can't reach me at all?",
            "answer": "<p>Please provide a reachable phone number and complete address. If an order is confirmed lost in transit or returned to us as undeliverable, the refund policy provides a full refund after the carrier status is verified. Return or redelivery costs caused by an incorrect address or an unresponsive recipient may be deducted from the refund.</p><p><a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">Read the refund policy</a></p>",
            "sources": ""
          }
        }
      },
