    "faq_more": {
      "type": "faq-hub",
      "blocks": {
        "m1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Order Status",
            "tags": "on-hold,why,verification",
            "question": "Why does my order say “On-Hold”?",
            "answer": "<p>We’re just checking something, usually a quick address/phone confirm or packaging step. Your tracking link shows the latest. If we need anything, we’ll text or email you right away.</p>",
            "sources": ""
          }
        },
        "m2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Payments & COD",
            "tags": "payment,cod",
            "question": "Payment options (incl. COD)",
            "answer": "<p>We accept major cards and, where offered, <strong>Cash on Delivery</strong> locally. If COD isn’t shown for your basket/area, choose card payment.</p>",
            "sources": ""
          }
        },
        "m2b": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Payments & COD",
            "tags": "cod,prepaid,switch,pay by link,card,change payment",
            "question": "Can I switch my COD order to prepaid?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. If your order hasn’t been dispatched yet, message us your order number and we’ll send a <strong>secure payment link</strong>. Once paid, your order ships as prepaid: no cash needed at the door and hand-off is faster.</p>",
            "sources": ""
          }
        },
        "m2c": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Order Status",
            "tags": "cancel,cancellation,refund timeline,change order",
            "question": "How do I cancel my order?",
            "answer": "<p>Email support@nootropix.shop with your order number as soon as possible. If the order has already been dispatched, the published return and refund terms apply.</p><p><a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">Read the refund policy</a></p>",
            "sources": ""
          }
        },
        "m3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Returns & Refunds",
            "tags": "returns,refunds,collection",
            "question": "Returns & refunds (local deliveries)",
            "answer": "<p>We’ll arrange a pickup and confirm the time by SMS/WhatsApp. Keep items sealed/unopened. Once received and inspected, refunds are processed within <strong>7–14 business days</strong>. See our <a href=\"/pages/shipping-and-returns\">Shipping &amp; Returns policy</a>.</p>",
            "sources": ""
          }
        },
        "m4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Website & Account",
            "tags": "checkout,account,link order",
            "question": "Checkout help & linking guest orders",
            "answer": "<p>If checkout hiccups, try another payment or a private window. Want us to link a guest order to your account? Message us your order number and email. Done.</p>",
            "sources": ""
          }
        },
        "m5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Availability & Restock",
            "tags": "restock,notify,substitute",
            "question": "Back in stock & alternatives",
            "answer": "<p>On the product page, tap “Notify me” to get an alert. Need it sooner? We’ll suggest close alternatives that can ship today.</p>",
            "sources": ""
          }
        },
        "m6": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Product Quality & COA",
            "tags": "coa,testing,batch",
            "question": "Certificates of Analysis (COA)",
            "answer": "<p>Product-specific documents are linked on the product page or in the COA library when available. Review the document for its lot, date, laboratory, method, and test scope. If nothing is linked, email support@nootropix.shop with the product and lot number to ask what documentation exists.</p>",
            "sources": ""
          }
        },
        "m7": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Legality & Import",
            "tags": "compliance,customs",
            "question": "Is this product legal in my country?",
            "answer": "<p>We can’t provide legal advice. Rules differ by country and customs. If an item is flagged, we’ll ship the rest now and hold/cancel the flagged item. We’ll keep you updated at every step.</p>",
            "sources": ""
          }
        },
        "m8": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Delivery & Refunds",
            "tags": "delivery failure,refund,our fault",
            "question": "What if delivery fails?",
            "answer": "<p>If an order is confirmed lost in transit or returned to us as undeliverable, you are entitled to a full refund after carrier status is verified. Shipping charges are non-refundable except where required by law or where the return is due to our error.</p><p><a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">Read the refund policy</a></p>",
            "sources": ""
          }
        },
        "m9": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Delivery & Refunds",
            "tags": "customs,seizure,international,import",
            "question": "What if my international order is seized or held by customs?",
            "answer": "<p>Customs duties, taxes, import charges, and local eligibility are the recipient’s responsibility. A customs hold must be reviewed against the carrier status and published policies; email support@nootropix.shop with your order number for the applicable next step.</p><p><a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">Read the shipping policy</a></p>",
            "sources": ""
          }
        },
        "m10": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "category": "UAE-wide Delivery",
            "tags": "driver,unreachable,rto,local delivery",
            "question": "What happens if the driver can't reach me?",
            "answer": "<p>Please provide a reachable phone number and complete address. If an order is confirmed lost in transit or returned to us as undeliverable, the refund policy provides a full refund after carrier status is verified. Return or redelivery costs caused by an incorrect address or an unresponsive recipient may be deducted from the refund.</p><p><a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">Read the refund policy</a></p>",
            "sources": ""
          }
        }
      },
